      "options": {
        "content": "<p>Expected operator workflow: confirm the metric symptom here, inspect syslog with <code>scripts/syslog-summary.sh</code>, then move to OpenNMS for events, outages, node detail, and interfaces. Fast telemetry answers \"what changed now?\" Classical NMS answers \"what object failed and what record do I keep?\"</p>",
